  "bio": "Ryugendo, a supremely skilled tattoo artist, specializes in traditional Japanese styles out of his studio in Tokyo, Japan. His expertise lies in \"Tebori\", a renowned hand-poking tattoo technique essential to authentic Japanese designs, and hosts displays of his craft at various tattoo festivals such as the Offenburg Tattoo Festival in May.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Tokyo, Japan\n\n🇯🇵Roppongi Tokyo🇯🇵 No DM, Booking Info→https://ryugendo.jp",
